<div class="ecom-builder" id="ecom-faqs"><div class="ecom-sections" data-section-id="{{section.id}}"><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-pyvtpn0qur" data-id="ecom-pyvtpn0qur" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="1" class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core ecom-7cfb7w2vmm"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-f7pj651easd" data-core-is="group"><div class="ecom-core ecom-group core__block ecom-51mehjbl1sk"> <div class="core__group--wrapper tabs__wrapper ecom__element ecom__tabs tabs__wrapper--horizontal tabs__wrapper--vertical" data-r="" style=""><div class="tabs__navs tabs__navs--vertical" style="--ecom-tab-nav-width: 30%; --ecom-tab-nav-width__tablet: 40%; --ecom-tab-nav-width__mobile: 30%;"><div class="tabs__navs--items"><div class="ecom-items tabs__nav ecom-item-active" data-target=""><div class="tabs_nav--content_right"><div class="tabs_nav--content"><h3 class="tabs_nav--text ecom-items--text">Account Issues</h3></div><div class="tabs_nav--sub-text"></div></div></div><div class="ecom-items tabs__nav" data-target=""><div class="tabs_nav--content_right"><div class="tabs_nav--content"><h3 class="tabs_nav--text ecom-items--text">Order Issues</h3></div><div class="tabs_nav--sub-text"></div></div></div><div class="ecom-items tabs__nav" data-target=""><div class="tabs_nav--content_right"><div class="tabs_nav--content"><h3 class="tabs_nav--text ecom-items--text">Payment Issues</h3></div><div class="tabs_nav--sub-text"></div></div></div><div class="ecom-items tabs__nav" data-target=""><div class="tabs_nav--content_right"><div class="tabs_nav--content"><h3 class="tabs_nav--text ecom-items--text">Logistics Issues</h3></div><div class="tabs_nav--sub-text"></div></div></div><div class="ecom-items tabs__nav" data-target=""><div class="tabs_nav--content_right"><div class="tabs_nav--content"><h3 class="tabs_nav--text ecom-items--text">Website Issues</h3></div><div class="tabs_nav--sub-text"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="core__group--items" style="--ecom-tab-item-width: 70%; --ecom-tab-item-width__tablet: 60%; --ecom-tab-item-width__mobile: 70%;"><div id="ecom-ntg2xxsxs3" class="core__group--item tab__item ecom-item-active ecom-item-group-init" data-id="ecom-ntg2xxsxs3"><div class="core__group--body tabs__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-38nh5otb2zv" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>FAQs</b></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-r61sxh97uj" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>1. Account Issues</b></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-cpzf5oduvxa" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>How do I create an account?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-43ukf4n6gc4" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">To create an account, simply click on the "My Account" button in the upper right corner of the homepage. Follow the instructions to enter your email address, set a password, and provide the required personal information. Your account will then be successfully registered.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-jet285ye9wl" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>I forgot my password, what should I do?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-mcqoiqqhio" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">If you forgot your password, click on the "Forgot Password" link on the login page. Enter the email address you registered with. The system will send you an email to reset your password. Follow the instructions provided in the email.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-czq2wlkszp" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>Can I change my account information?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-kv013dqrav" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Yes, you can change your account information at any time. Log in and visit the "Personal Center" section. Click on "Edit Information" to change your username, contact information, address, and other details.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-nis491aucn" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>How do I delete my account?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-m3kh1hrsqta" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">If you want to delete your account, please send us a deletion request through the "Contact" page. Our customer service will process your request as quickly as possible and confirm the account deletion.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-zgq54h4x9c" class="core__group--item tab__item" data-id="ecom-zgq54h4x9c"><div class="core__group--body tabs__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="1"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-85eyp31dn7j" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>FAQs</b></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-z2huarc3ivc" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>2. Order Issues</b></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-65lvwx6kmxe" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>How do I check the status of my order?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-weai1jmv05" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Log in to your account and go to the "My Orders" page to check the status of your order and the logistics information. If you do not have an account, you can also track your order using the order number on our "Order Inquiry" page.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-qlr1253dbjj" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>How can I cancel an order?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-02fh8199k39o" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Orders can be canceled before shipping. If you have an Indevolt account, you can cancel the order directly in your account. If you placed the order without logging in, please contact our customer service, provide your order number, and explain the reason for the cancellation. We will handle the process for you.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-h34lwjea4d8" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>Are refunds granted?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-sr36ykntfe" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Yes, we offer a refund service. For eligible products, you can request a refund within 30 days of receiving your order. For more information, please visit our "Warranty and Return Policy" page.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-7wdgsduyj97" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>When will the order be shipped?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-ctsx61vqo95" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">The normal delivery time is 1-3 business days after successful payment. For more information, please check the order management section under "My Account."</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-vgc8yi0crfl" class="core__group--item tab__item" data-id="ecom-vgc8yi0crfl"><div class="core__group--body tabs__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="2"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-gh4j7fhb7ui" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>FAQs</b></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-nnjf0v7hl1h" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>3. Payment Issues</b></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-8d5hzenpbzs" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>What payment methods are available?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-ehpz7f57wqe" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">We support a variety of payment methods, including PayPal and credit cards. At checkout, you can select the payment method that suits you best.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-h5gne3qiv9h" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db">
<div><b>Why did the payment fail?</b></div></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-q8e4ruzpcq8" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed"><div><div><ol><li>Clear the cookies in your current browser or try using a different browser (e.g., Google Chrome).</li><li>Switch to another device (smartphone, computer, or tablet) and check if the payment works there.</li><li>Contact your bank to clarify whether international fees are accepted.</li><li>If the steps above do not help or if you have further questions, please send us a screenshot of the issue, the exact time the problem occurred, as well as the device and browser you used.</li></ol></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-kl2xp41xkla" class="core__group--item tab__item" data-id="ecom-kl2xp41xkla"><div class="core__group--body tabs__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="3"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-6yeyffawzqx" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>FAQs</b></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-55xmq00jxi8" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>4. Logistics Issues</b></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-x8gl3fwwqed" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>How long does shipping take?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-f6nfkz0iphi" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">In Germany, you will receive your order within 3-7 business days. In Austria, the delivery time is 6-12 business days.&nbsp;</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-t98ltfzns4" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>To which countries do you ship?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-8j9wgi076cs" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Currently, we only ship Indevolt balcony storage products and accessories to Germany and Austria. Additional European countries will be added gradually.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-9ppviy8510u" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>How is my shipment sent?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-q6pk4zstlf8" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Our logistics partners include DHL, EMS, FedEx, USPS, DPD, and others. We choose the shipping service provider that is most suitable for your shipping address.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-71kzmoapw2g" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>Is shipping free?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-s1a4r9nmrml" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Yes, Indevolt offers free shipping on all orders.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-si8to4swwb9" class="core__group--item tab__item" data-id="ecom-si8to4swwb9"><div class="core__group--body tabs__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="4"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-xgsdw54se7" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>FAQs</b></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-mnz18n9ne7m" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>5. Website Issues</b></h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-17n31mb5qwi" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>Contact Customer Service:</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-mqlrl0p8nq8" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">TEL: +49 (0)174 3150766
<div>Email: Write to <a href="mailto:support.eu@indevolt.com">support.eu@indevolt.com&nbsp;</a> &nbsp;</div></div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-r7g6kjlhk7c" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>
</b><div><b>Is the website secure?</b></div></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-2ep9816kbgh" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Our website uses modern SSL/TLS encryption to protect your personal data and payment information. All payment information is transmitted securely to prevent data leaks.</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-znz3nph5pif" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>How do I subscribe to emails?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-9pszni3z9dq" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">To receive the latest news and offers, enter your email address in the subscription box at the bottom of the website and click "Subscribe"</div></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-028belq8i8yc" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h6 class="ecom__heading ecom-db"><b>How can I unsubscribe from emails?</b></h6></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-4dn23j79qfg" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">If you no longer wish to receive emails from us, please click on the "Unsubscribe" link at the bottom of each email. If you have any questions, our customer service team is always happy to assist you.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-iw61c8n6jo" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__code exporting" deep="1"><script defer="defer" src="https://www.dwin1.com/110350.js" type="text/javascript"></script></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section>
